{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 36, :comments ["<b>And they shall clear the house.</b> The master of the house and all the people of his household. And the reason for the plural form is to clear it out quickly." "<b>Before the priest comes.</b> For the house may yet be shut up because of the doubt, and before his arrival its status is doubtful."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 14, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:10:10.460972517Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}